<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Einstein/Noah raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Einstein/Noah raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Einstein/Noah Bagel Corp to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept Einstein/Noah as intermediate-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Einstein/Noah gained 3/4 to 15.</p>
</text>
